[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5163.99, "timestamp": "01:26:03", "text": "我真希望我当时也在场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5167.03, "timestamp": "01:26:07", "text": "您随时可以发起协作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5169.59, "timestamp": "01:26:09", "text": "是的。或者出去玩玩什么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5171.43, "timestamp": "01:26:11", "text": "绝对地。我总是很乐意做类似的事情，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5173.75, "timestamp": "01:26:13", "text": "你知道，放松和合作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5176.31, "timestamp": "01:26:16", "text": "一般情况下，当我不旅行或不……的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5182.47, "timestamp": "01:26:22", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5185.91, "timestamp": "01:26:25", "text": "那么，前辈，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5187.51, "timestamp": "01:26:27", "text": "你最期待的是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5193.42, "timestamp": "01:26:33", "text": "嗯，问得好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5196.03, "timestamp": "01:26:36", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5199.59, "timestamp": "01:26:39", "text": "嗯，我想把所有的话都说出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5203.99, "timestamp": "01:26:43", "text": "嗯。去日本是我梦寐以求的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5208.39, "timestamp": "01:26:48", "text": "我的。我从未想过我能拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5209.91, "timestamp": "01:26:49", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5212.709, "timestamp": "01:26:52", "text": "而我能够去这件事本身就足以说明问题了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5218.79, "timestamp": "01:26:58", "text": "所以我为你感到无比骄傲和开心"}]